<li id="bib.bib11" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_bibitem">[11]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib11.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
PixVerse.
